00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:12.524
- So about eight years
ago, I was on a bus,

00:03:12.524 --> 00:03:13.910
I was on my way home quite late at night,

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:15.530
and I was on the phone to my mum.

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:17.280
And, really distracted,

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:19.520
